    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713290/extras/f93bfc88dae0cf851990ed8847a40e9c.webp?t=1752747591\" width=616 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey through  a strange, beautiful world where your choices matter - and your silence speaks volumes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in an unfamiliar land, alone and disoriented, with no clear path forward. The world is calm, but feels just a little bit off - like a memory half-remembered or a dream slipping away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won't fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won\u2019t craft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you\u2019ll learn, connect, and change things... if you\u2019re paying attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s not about saving the world, it\u2019s about understanding it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-first design with rich dialogue and meaningful choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mystical puzzles solved with a bow, precision, and logic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world that reacts to your presence - even when you say nothing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warm yet haunting visuals and sound.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple outcomes, secrets, and emotional depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713290/extras/f93bfc88dae0cf851990ed8847a40e9c.webp?t=1752747591\" width=616 height=32 /></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713290/extras/f93bfc88dae0cf851990ed8847a40e9c.webp?t=1752747591\" width=616 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey through  a strange, beautiful world where your choices matter - and your silence speaks volumes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in an unfamiliar land, alone and disoriented, with no clear path forward. The world is calm, but feels just a little bit off - like a memory half-remembered or a dream slipping away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won't fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won\u2019t craft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you\u2019ll learn, connect, and change things... if you\u2019re paying attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s not about saving the world, it\u2019s about understanding it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-first design with rich dialogue and meaningful choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mystical puzzles solved with a bow, precision, and logic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world that reacts to your presence - even when you say nothing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warm yet haunting visuals and sound.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple outcomes, secrets, and emotional depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713290/extras/f93bfc88dae0cf851990ed8847a40e9c.webp?t=1752747591\" width=616 height=32 /></span></p></li></ul>",
